      "start_line": 27,
      "text": "  rule ((triAt(I -Int 1) +Int triAt(I -Int 2)) +Int 1)\n       +Int (((I +Int 1) -Int pyMod(I +Int 1, 2)) /Int 2)\n    => triAt(I)\n    requires I >=Int 3 andBool pyMod(I, 2) ==Int 1\n    [simplification]"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [
        "simplification"
      ],
      "end_line": 40,
      "module": "TRI-VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "b0d5d32b6d6da30b8df12d8dc4bcd5eed64ca172053bb4d19b8e4ea5a823e019",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-b0d5d32b6d6da30b8df12d8dc4bcd5eed64ca172053bb4d19b8e4ea5a823e019",
      "start_line": 34,
      "text": "  rule ((triAt(I:Int +Int -1) +Int triAt(I +Int -2)) +Int 1)\n       +Int (((I +Int 1)\n              -Int ((((I +Int 1) %Int 2) +Int 2) %Int 2)) /Int 2)\n    => triAt(I)\n    requires I >=Int 3\n     andBool (((I %Int 2) +Int 2) %Int 2) ==Int 1\n    [simplification]"
    },
